{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udfae About This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Help the Vtuber \u201cAllegro Molto\u201d reach her live streaming room!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>\u201c\u3042\u308c\u3050\u308d\u3082\u308b\u3068\u3092\u306f\u3053\u3076\u30b2\u30fc\u30e0\u201d</i> is a casual action game featuring the Japanese Vtuber <strong>Allegro Molto</strong> and\u00a0<strong>Lead the cat</strong>.<br>Take control of Lead and guide Allegro Molto to the goal\u2014just make sure she doesn\u2019t fall along the way! Be careful, but don\u2019t waste time\u2014this is a game of balance and speed!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udce6 Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A simple action game starring <strong>Allegro Molto</strong> and\u00a0<strong>Lead the cat</strong> (includes 1 stage)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Easy controls</strong>: Tap or click the left and right sides of the screen to play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Reach a score of 100 to clear the game</strong>\u2014drop Molto and it\u2019s game over!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Each session takes 2 to 5 minutes</strong>, perfect for quick play sessions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Retry as many times as you like</strong>\u2014fast-paced and replay-friendly</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>No ads, no in-app purchases, no DLC</strong>\u2014just pure gameplay!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f How to Play</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Click or tap the right side</strong> of the screen to make Lead move faster</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Click or tap the left side</strong> to slow Lead down</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3638540?t=1745219065","background_raw":"https